Technical analysis, safe proof-of-concept material, and reproducible source checks for a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in TypeMill's SVG sanitizer.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> VulDB assigned `CVE-2026-120218` on October 31, 2026. At the time this repository was prepared, the CVE Program API had not yet published the canonical record and returned `CVE_RECORD_DNE`. [VDB-429569](https://vuldb.com/vuln/429569) is the current public assignment source. This notice should be removed when the CVE record becomes available.

